(5723864, 832403, 62187, '<td valign="top">Good Lord...obviously the winner. Of course you see the only flaw...I doubt I need to point it out. Attention to detail can be hard...but overlooked too...10...</td>', 'Good Lord...obviously the winner. Of course you see the only flaw...I doubt I need to point it out. Attention to detail can be hard...but overlooked too...10...', '2009-11-11 21:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
