(5725077, 832833, 106806, '<td valign="top">*sigh* 4 .... not the score but the number of photos in a row that are frankly just out of this world. I''love the way ... dang it I love everyhing about this photo.  .... Its said that a photo should not rely.. nay  should not need a caption and it occured to me as I was reviewing my voting that I did''nt even register that this photo *had* a caption.</td>', '*sigh* 4 .... not the score but the number of photos in a row that are frankly just out of this world. I''love the way ... dang it I love everyhing about this photo.  .... Its said that a photo should not rely.. nay  should not need a caption and it occured to me as I was reviewing my voting that I did''nt even register that this photo *had* a caption.', '2009-11-13 02:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
