(5726082, 832912, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a highly emotive tribute to a great Master still missed. There is grief and sadness in Loss but there is also Learning &amp; a universal unspoken Connection. Superb photograph &amp; hands down my favourite in this challenge. The face is silent but the message is still very clear - honour what has been lost &amp; go on.</td>', 'This is a highly emotive tribute to a great Master still missed. There is grief and sadness in Loss but there is also Learning & a universal unspoken Connection. Superb photograph & hands down my favourite in this challenge. The face is silent but the message is still very clear - honour what has been lost & go on.', '2009-11-14 00:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726083, 832638, 111808, '<td valign="top">Methinks the Pumpkin King has a certain red cousin...Artfully fierce!</td>', 'Methinks the Pumpkin King has a certain red cousin...Artfully fierce!', '2009-11-14 00:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726085, 832323, 111808, '<td valign="top">Performance is over &amp; so the Mime sleeps...delightful whimsy surrounded by reflections including an unintentional specular heart highlight - my only suggestion might be a tighter crop as my view keeps going back to the passersby on the right.</td>', 'Performance is over & so the Mime sleeps...delightful whimsy surrounded by reflections including an unintentional specular heart highlight - my only suggestion might be a tighter crop as my view keeps going back to the passersby on the right.', '2009-11-14 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
