(5726232, 832788, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool shot - love the lighting and the feel of the image, the pose of the model, and how her head and the two glass globes provide a continuation of theme</td>', 'cool shot - love the lighting and the feel of the image, the pose of the model, and how her head and the two glass globes provide a continuation of theme', '2009-11-14 08:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
