(5726729, 832133, 3032, '<td valign="top">Would have liked some interaction with the photographer, the earplug is a bit of a distraction (but that is his fault if he is not your model).</td>', 'Would have liked some interaction with the photographer, the earplug is a bit of a distraction (but that is his fault if he is not your model).', '2009-11-14 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726730, 832144, 3032, '<td valign="top">Clowns make me seriously unhappy, but I like the interaction close in your face of this. I smirked. :)</td>', 'Clowns make me seriously unhappy, but I like the interaction close in your face of this. I smirked. :)', '2009-11-14 16:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726731, 832327, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, paintjob and expression/interaction. Good.</td>', 'I like the lighting, paintjob and expression/interaction. Good.', '2009-11-14 16:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726734, 832304, 3032, '<td valign="top">Light is from the wrong side to put the emphasis on the face paint, that also makes it almost impossible to get the right contrast/tonal balance.</td>', 'Light is from the wrong side to put the emphasis on the face paint, that also makes it almost impossible to get the right contrast/tonal balance.', '2009-11-14 16:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726735, 832788, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but it is to clear in the balance of the image that it is a sortof studio setup. Softer light might have worked better. + less on the background and less on the arms. Especially the neck is pretty bright and draws the eye out of the face. Miss some light in the closest eye (bounce it back in with a reflector)</td>', 'I like the idea here, but it is to clear in the balance of the image that it is a sortof studio setup. Softer light might have worked better. + less on the background and less on the arms. Especially the neck is pretty bright and draws the eye out of the face. Miss some light in the closest eye (bounce it back in with a reflector)', '2009-11-14 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726736, 832918, 3032, '<td valign="top">Too soft/moved/out of focus for me. But the paintjob is nice.</td>', 'Too soft/moved/out of focus for me. But the paintjob is nice.', '2009-11-14 16:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726739, 832890, 3032, '<td valign="top">Toning is a bit flat, subject centered and doubt between full face or more cutt-off. A more panoramic crop, with the emphasize on the eyes and stronger light balance would have worked better for me.</td>', 'Toning is a bit flat, subject centered and doubt between full face or more cutt-off. A more panoramic crop, with the emphasize on the eyes and stronger light balance would have worked better for me.', '2009-11-14 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726740, 832880, 3032, '<td valign="top">There is absolutely nothing that shows me that a face is painted. DOF is very narrow, lighting balance is too dark and the colors don''t pop.</td>', 'There is absolutely nothing that shows me that a face is painted. DOF is very narrow, lighting balance is too dark and the colors don''t pop.', '2009-11-14 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726742, 832758, 3032, '<td valign="top">The very bright background destroys the power that the photo might have.</td>', 'The very bright background destroys the power that the photo might have.', '2009-11-14 16:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726745, 832990, 3032, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the lighting of this. It is too flat. The highlight is on the ear/hair and not the face. Like the crop/positioning. Maybe bouncing some light back in the face would work better.</td>', 'Don''t like the lighting of this. It is too flat. The highlight is on the ear/hair and not the face. Like the crop/positioning. Maybe bouncing some light back in the face would work better.', '2009-11-14 16:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
