(5732122, 832912, 52549, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think it''s wonderful, despite the fact that you''re not completely satisfied with it. It brings over the title perfectly and I love the sad look on the (your) clowns face. Great work. Be happy, here''s a ((Hug ;-)))</td>', 'Personally, I think it''s wonderful, despite the fact that you''re not completely satisfied with it. It brings over the title perfectly and I love the sad look on the (your) clowns face. Great work. Be happy, here''s a ((Hug ;-)))', '2009-11-18 10:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
