(5738835, 832918, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from a member of the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge. <br/> <br/>This is a nice shot, what would have helped you is focus.  Your focus is very soft.  I see that your ISO is fairly high here so it may have been a darker room and that is why you needed more ISO. Sharpness would be the key in this shot, You have a nice blurred background that does compliment the face with its lighter colours.  The score reflects your lack of focus and sharpness., <br/> <br/>You did okay for your first entry and I look forward to seeing more from you!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from a member of the Critique Club! You asked that your photograph be critiqued by a member of the Critique Club in this challenge.  This is a nice shot, what would have helped you is focus.  Your focus is very soft.  I see that your ISO is fairly high here so it may have been a darker room and that is why you needed more ISO. Sharpness would be the key in this shot, You have a nice blurred background that does compliment the face with its lighter colours.  The score reflects your lack of focus and sharpness.,  You did okay for your first entry and I look forward to seeing more from you! ', '2009-11-23 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
